## Python / Pandas Patterns

### Filtering
```python
df[df["x"] >= 100]

df[(df["x"] >= 100) & (df["y"] > 0.25)]
```

### Grouping and Aggregation
```python
summary = df.groupby("id").agg(
    count=("transaction_id", "count"),
    avg=("amount", "mean"),
    total=("amount", "sum"),
    rate=("binary_flag", "mean")
).reset_index()
```

### Merging
```python
df1.merge(df2, on="merchant_id", how="left")

df1.merge(
    df2,
    left_on="merchant_id",
    right_on="id",
    how="left"
)
```

### Missing Values
```python
df["x"].isnull().sum()
df[df["x"].isnull()]
df["x"] = df["x"].fillna(0)
```

### Dates
```python
df["date"] = pd.to_datetime(df["date"])
df["date"].dt.year
df["date"].dt.month
```

### Duplicates
```python
df[df["id"].duplicated(keep=False)]
df.drop_duplicates(subset="id", keep="first")
```

### Conditional Logic
```python
df["flag"] = np.where(df["amount"] > 0, 1, 0)
```

